  "body": "Welcome to a home where modern family living meets an enviable Narrow Neck Beach lifestyle.\r\n\r\nPrivately positioned on a back section in a quiet cul-de-sac, this beautifully presented home offers spacious rooms, comfort and flexible living on this family-friendly road. A handy walkway connects through to Seabreeze Road and towards the beach, placing you moments away from everything this sought-after location offers.\r\n\r\nSet over two levels, the home is designed for easy, low-maintenance living. It offers up to five generous bedrooms plus a versatile study nook, and three bathrooms, providing plenty of room for families, guests and that all-important work-from-home flexibility.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stylish open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, creating a welcoming space everyday. Upstairs, there are glimpses of Rangitoto to remind you just how special your surroundings are. Step outside and the lifestyle continues. Decking and wrap-around courtyard gardens create lovely outdoor spaces for morning coffee, summer entertaining or simply enjoying the peace and privacy of this tucked-away setting.\r\n\r\nThe double internal-access garage, along with good off-street parking, adds valuable practicality, while the home's excellent condition means you can simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nNarrow Neck Beach is only a few minutes’ walk away—perfect for a morning swim, an evening stroll along the sand or a relaxing weekend by the water. The Wakatere Sailing Club, the Devonport squash club and gym, children's bike track and park, and Waitemata Golf Club are all close by too, meaning recreation and community are almost right on your front gate. Fabulous schooling is close by; the home is in zone for Takapuna Grammar school, and it is a 15 minute walk or a few minutes' drive to Devonport village with the ferry to the CBD.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of modern family living, privacy, outdoor space and such a superb beachside location are rarely found but often sought after!\r\n\r\nIf you’ve been waiting for that special Narrow Neck opportunity, this could be the one. Call us today and discover how easy coastal family living can be.",
